                <head>123. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On July 25, 1952, President Truman approved NSC 127/1, “Plan for Conducting
                    Psychological Operations During General Hostilities,” of the same date. NSC
                    127/1 was an amended version of NSC 127, same title, March 3, 1952. NSC 127 and
                    NSC 127/1 are in National Archives, RG 59, S/S–NSC Files: Lot 63 D 351, NSC 127
                    Series, Box 67.</p>
            </div>
